1. Condition

The Covered Work is provided to you by the Licensor under the Base License,
subject to this Condition. Without limiting other conditions in the Base
License, the grant of rights under the Base License does not include, and the
Base License does not grant to you, the right to Resell the Covered Work or a
Modified Version.

2. Definitions

"Covered Work" means the material identified above, in Source or Object form,
to the extent the Licensor holds copyright in it.

"Modified Version" means any work that is based on the Covered Work or on a
substantial part of it and that changes, adds to, translates or adapts it,
including a Derivative Work as defined in the Base License.

"Resell" means to provide to a third party, for a fee or any other
consideration:
  (a) a copy of the Covered Work or of a Modified Version, whether on its own
      or included in a larger product, package or distribution; or
  (b) access to the Covered Work or a Modified Version, or to its
      functionality, as a hosted, network or managed service, where that
      access is all or a substantial part of what the third party pays for.

3. What this Condition does not restrict

For clarity, this Condition does not restrict you from:
  (a) using the Covered Work or a Modified Version for any purpose, including
      within a for-profit organisation and for its internal operations, and
      including use by its employees and contractors on its behalf;
  (b) studying, inspecting and modifying the Covered Work, and developing on
      it;
  (c) distributing copies of the Covered Work or a Modified Version free of
      charge, in compliance with the Base License and this Condition;
  (d) charging for your own work that is neither a copy of the Covered Work
      or a Modified Version nor access to it, such as consulting, support,
      training, integration or development services;
  (e) selling or licensing software, data, models or services that you
      created and that do not include the Covered Work or a Modified Version,
      even if they interoperate with it;
  (f) using the output that the Covered Work produces when you run it.

4. Attribution and origin

In addition to Section 4 of the Base License:
  (a) You must keep intact every copyright, attribution and licence notice of
      Fylume and of third parties that is included in the Covered Work,
      including the NOTICE file.
  (b) You must not remove or alter the attribution to Fylume, and you must not
      claim or imply that you are the author of the Covered Work or of any
      part of it that you did not write.
  (c) A Modified Version that you distribute or make available must carry a
      prominent notice stating that it has been modified, by whom, and
      approximately when. It must not be presented as an original Fylume
      release, or as made, approved or endorsed by Fylume.

5. Keeping this Condition with the Covered Work

Whenever you distribute the Covered Work or a Modified Version, you must
include this Condition together with the Base License, and any licence notice
or attribution that the Base License requires must also refer to this
Condition. Section 4 of the Base License, which allows you to apply your own
terms to your own modifications, does not allow you to remove or relax this
Condition for the Covered Work or for the parts of a Modified Version that
come from the Covered Work.

6. Third-party and share-alike material

This Condition applies only to material in which the Licensor holds
copyright. It does not restrict any right that a third party has granted,
including rights under the licences listed in THIRD-PARTY.md. It does not
apply to any material that the Licensor distributes under CC BY-SA 4.0 or
under any other licence that forbids additional restrictions.

7. Brand assets

The Fylume and Yaob logos, symbols, wordmarks and other brand artwork included
in the Covered Work (in web/public/brand/, excluding the font files and their
licence files) are licensed under these terms only to be reproduced unchanged
as part of the Covered Work or of a Modified Version. Section 6 of the Base
License applies to the names and marks "Fylume", "Yaob" and "MPN Studio".

8. Other permissions

You may ask Fylume for permission to do something that this Condition does
not allow, including reselling. Such permission is given only in a separate
written agreement with Fylume.
Contact: https://fylu.me (Fylume) or the issue tracker at
https://github.com/sarja-technologies/yaob/issues.

9. Precedence

Where this Condition and the Base License conflict, this Condition governs.
This Condition adds no warranty and no liability; Sections 7 and 8 of the Base
License apply to the Covered Work.


